{
	//Strings from Maps
	"Strings.FaustDialogue.1": "You aren't supposed to see this....oh...now I have to tell Ginnungagap about this...!",
	"Strings.WitchHouse.1": "There is a bunch of potion bottles and tinctures spread out on most surfaces. ^Reading the labels makes your head spin for some reason...",
	"Strings.WitchHouse.2": "It's not quite clear what's in these jars and bottles or if it's used for spellcraft or cooking...huh.",
	"Strings.WitchHouse.3": "A purple liquid is cooking on the stove...it has quite a sweet smell. Actually...it's so sweet it's almost suffocating...",
	"Strings.WitchHouse.4": "You try to open the fridge but something seems to hold onto the door from the inside.",
	"Strings.WitchHouse.5": "The table invites you to sit down and have a little seance. What could go wrong?",
	"Strings.WitchHouse.6": "You look at the telephone and it suddenly starts to ring. After a few seconds it just stops, yet you seem to hear some muffled words from the other side.",
	"Strings.WitchHouse.7": "The bookcase is stuffed with books, scrolls and other things used for spellcraft. It's so stuffed that it almost seems as if it is groaning from all the weight...",
	"Strings.WitchHouse.8": "More books and alike are found in this bookshelf. Though it seems that none are written in a language you know...",
	"Strings.WitchHouse.9": "A stack of books with a lot of bookmarks inside. Most of them have a variety of topics focused on breaking the 4th wall.",
	"Strings.WitchHouse.10": "Neatly taken notes and random bits of recipe snippets are scattered around the table. Looking closer you can see something signed with 'Faust'.",
	"Strings.WitchHouse.11": "A tower of books that seems to almost tip over...yet something keeps it in place.",
	"Strings.WitchHouse.12": "A big cauldron that is currently empty...there are scratch marks inside and a faint smell of brimstone and sulfur lingering in the air...",
	"Strings.WitchHouse.13": "Freshly brewed potions that have yet to be labeled...",
	"Strings.WitchHouse.14": "Ground-uhhh...substances in different colors. Better not to test and see what it could be...",
	"Strings.WitchHouse.15": "A little pillow that has a particular dent in it. There is a small sign on the wall above it reading 'Fausts favorite sleeping spot'.",
	"Strings.WitchHouse.16": "Potions, dried herbs, gems and other things are laid out in a particular way.",
	"Strings.WitchHouse.17": "A sun shaped stone is floating above the altar. It's radiating warmth and calmness...",
	"Strings.WitchHouse.18": "A bundle of dried herbs, flowers and alike tied together for cleansing.",
	"Strings.WitchHouse.19": "The workspace of a certain witch. Somehow you don't dare to take a look at the personal notes...",
	"Strings.WitchDen.0": "Please do not fish in the mana pool. You will not catch anything thanks to the barrier.^Don't waste your time.",
	
	//Locations
	"Locations.WitchDen": "Witch Den",
	"Locations.WitchHouse": "The VoidWitch's house",
	
	//Shop Dialogue
	"VWW.Dialogue.1": "Master sent me here...do you want to buy something?",
	
	//Events
	"CP.Letter.VoidWitch": "Greetings, mortal Farmer,^^It came to my ears that you have been doing many things in the valley.^^While I tend to keep to myself, my familiar, Faust, evinced curiosity in visit your residential area.^^He shall bring new curiosities for the month of Samhain from my personal repository.^^As above, so below.^^-The Void Witch",
	"CP.Letter.VoidWitch.Title": "The witch beckons",
	"CP.Letter.VoidWitch2": "Greetings, mortal Farmer,^^My familiar has been in the valley for a while now. I do hope that he has been not too much of a troublesome thing to you.^^As it so will I have a little recipe for you that might help if he is.^^If you have some time maybe make this dish and try giving it to him.^^As above, so below.^^-The Void Witch",
	"CP.Letter.VoidWitch.Title2": "A small gesture",
	
