	// FAUST DIALOGUE
	// GENERAL
	"Faust.Dialogue.DumpsterDiveComment": "Hey now, I appreciate your resourcefulness but can you do that a little bit more discreet?$6#$b#Not that I care. Just between the two of us...if you keep doing it there will be a fun surprise, just saying.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.HitBySlingshot": "You little-!$8#$b#You know what? Have this.$5#$action AddBuff 26 -2",
	"Faust.Dialogue.GreenRain": "Hm, yes. Master likes to collect this rain in bottles for later use quite often.#$b#It's potent in it's own way, just like moon water.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.GreenRainFinished": "Ah, it's already over.#$b#It was quite amusing to see the mortals huddled up together because of some rain.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.GreenRain2": "I've lost count of all the bottles of this rain is by now collected by my master...#$b#...how much to dare you drink one of the bottles?",
	"Faust.Dialogue.birthdayLoveA": "What a thoughtful gift, thank you.#$b#You always feed me well.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.birthdayLoveB": "Yum, just the right thing for today.#$b#Thank you for thinking of me.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.birthdayLikeA": "Thanks for remembering my birthday, friendly entity.#$b#I know exactly what to do with this.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.birthdayLikeB": "Oh, wow. You did quite a good job picking out a gift for me, I give my thanks.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.birthdayDislikeA": "So you just gonna bring me a birthday gift on my birthday to my birthday party on my birthday with a birthday gift?",
	"Faust.Dialogue.birthdayDislikeB": "Oh, you shouldn't have.#$b#No, really. You shouldn't have...$8#$b#Whose idea is it to gift such thing on someones birthday?$9",
	"Faust.Dialogue.birthdayNeutralA": "Ah, don't worry. It's the thought that counts, not the right gift.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.birthdayNeutralB": "Hm.#$b#Well, at least you remembered my birthday.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.RejectMovieTicket": "My apologies, but I do not care much about these kind of things.#$b#My lack of reactions would be quite bland for you anyway. ",
	"Faust.Gifttastes.Love": "Oh? You really do care for me, huh?#$b#What a lovely thing to give, you have my thanks.",
	"Faust.Gifttastes.Like": "A great item. Thank you for giving it to me. It'll serve me well.",
	"Faust.Gifttastes.Hate": "Of all the things in the world you give me this...#$b#...I thought better of you.",
	"Faust.Gifttastes.Dislike": "Not quite what interests me...but I am sure it will serve some kind of purpose.",
	"Faust.Gifttastes.Neutral": "Useful, yes. Do I care for it much? Mmmm...not really. Thanks anyway.",
	
	// DIALOGUE EXTRA
	"Faust.Dialogue.Introduction": "Ah, hello there. Don't mind me, I am just-...hm. Existing, yes.$1",
	
	// DIALOGUE 1ST OF SEASON
	"Faust.Dialogue.spring_1": "Life is about to rise once more blanketing it's warm embrace all around the valley...#$b#...I could not care less. If something exists or not is all the same to me.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.summer_1": "The cycle continues with the sun burning down upon us mercilessly from above and-...#$b#...siiiiiigh...$6#$b#...yadda, yadda, insert some deep meaningful words here.#$b#...anyway, can you fetch me some ice cream?",
	"Faust.Dialogue.fall_1": "The season of change, to some it's the season of bounty, for others it's the season of death.#$b#I personally quite like it.$2#$b#What about you?",
	"Faust.Dialogue.winter_1": "Hmmm...white isn't really my style.#$b#What do you think if we just blasted away all this snow with a firestorm?$7",
	
	//DIALOGUE 
	
	"Faust.Dialogue.Mon.0": "Say, humble friend, are there any things you fear in the world?#$b#How likely do you think they could come true?$1#$b#I've got some connections, you see? You know how there's things like exposure therapy and the like? We could work something out.$7#$b#You will thank me later, I'm sure.$4",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Mon.1": "I've caught a butterfly earlier today.#$b#I was considering just crushing it with my hand, but in the end I let it go.#$b#Bothering such small creatures is too boring anyway. You're more fun.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Mon.2": "Sometimes my master makes me do these outrageous errands and I think to myself why am I still listening to them?#$b#Then again...I would not exist without them. Existing sure is nice. I guess I can live with an errand or two that annoy me once in a while.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Mon.3": "I would love to see pigs fly. Actually, I'd love to see a good bunch of sayings come true just because the thought of that seems funny to me.#$b#What saying would you like to see come true, friend?",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Mon.4": "When I am bored I start to pick my skin.#$b#It regrows pretty quickly so I've a hard time stopping.#$b#................$2#$b#...well, that's not too odd now, is it? There's other things I do when I am bored but I was told by my master that those are mostly not-...hm, mortal-friendly.$8",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Mon.5": "Do you believe in love at first sight?#$b#If so, does that mean you also believe in hate at first sight?#$b#...love I don't know but I SURE know hate at first sight.$5",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Mon.6": "Your pet crossed past me the other day and just stopped in it's tracks to stare at me with big eyes.#$b#I don't know if I should feel flattered or insulted.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Mon.7": "I don't really talk much to mortals nowadays. You are quite the out-liner.#$b#Make of that what you will.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Mon.8": "Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet-$3#$b#...........$9#$b#-oh greetings and well met, friendly entity.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Mon.9": "I've been thinking about taking all my accumulated vacation days and maybe do some travelling.#$b#Ah, my master would never let me go. I already know that they will turn it into some sort of errand, hm.#$b#Oh well, that's the fate of mine, I suppose.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Mon.10": "Have you ever stared into the sun long enough you begin to see shapes?#$b#And you wonder if those shapes mean something and then the begin to move...#$b#Hate to break it to you but those aren't just shapes. Those are alive.$8",
	
	"Faust.Dialogue.Tue.0": "If someone told you you have to cut off a part of your body what would it be?#$b#I am asking for no reason at all.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Tue.1": "I've watched that magical mortal in the forest do those little magic tricks a few times now.#$b#Interesting to watch.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Tue.2": "Would you be interested in a perpetuum mobile?#$b#I know a guy who knows a guy that knows someone who got the blueprints for one.#$b#Just let me know and I'll go fetch them for you.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Tue.3": "Hm, I didn't feel like existing today but I had to run an errand.#$b#How fortunate that I ran into you.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Tue.4": "Well met, friendly entity. Would you mind coming here for a moment?#$action AddMoney -1000",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Tue.5": "You got me there, I have nothing of substance to say.#$b#Sometimes the best words are those left unsaid or whatever. Or was it that fewer words makes you less of a yapper?#$b#Eh.$2",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Tue.6": "Would you mind if I took a bite out of you?#$b#I'm feeling a bit restless.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Tue.7": "Recent studies have found out that being ready to kick a baby means higher chances of getting hit in the face. Coincidence? I think not.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Tue.8": "Would you believe me when I say that I've seen it all?#$b#What is 'all'? Well, I will leave that to your imagination.$1",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Tue.9": "Had any misfortune happen to you lately? Any crops wilting? Fallen flat onto your face? No?#$b#Hm, guess I have to get my dopamine somewhere else.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Tue.10": "I might as well take today's errands as reason to hunt for some fun for myself.#$b#Uuuuunless you got something exciting to do. Like going to the mines. No? What a pity, I was going to suggest tagging along.",

	"Faust.Dialogue.Wed.0": "One of these days I am going to scratch my eyes out.#$b#They're quite itchy, I keep peeking into the 5th layer of reality by accident.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Wed.1": "I enjoy sitting in warm cozy spots or in little nooks.#$b#Sometimes under beds, grabbing legs to scare people...",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Wed.2": "....................................................$9#$b#%You get no response, only more staring.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Wed.3": "If the one in the tower can give random people forest juice to make them understand ancient language, maybe I could offer some juices myself, hm.#$b#I shall talk with master about this.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Wed.4": "Watching these mortals roam around and go about their day is pretty boring.#$b#You're at least worth the watch with your little mine excursions and, uh...#$b# that..blue...one...$2#$b#giving you some errands to run.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Wed.5": "You know, every time you're on your own and it's deadly silent, in fact so silent it feels like there is some sort of static noise starting to happen...#$b#...that's the sound of the void beckoning you.$9#$b#....$8#$b#What are you waiting for, answer.$5",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Wed.6": "%You see his mouth move but cannot make sense of what he says to you. He just smiles.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Wed.7": "I've got another one of these colored pieces everyone seems to want. You can have it. [74]",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Wed.8": "Imagine some higher being descends down and tells you the way to solve the world is for one person you know to die who would you pick? And why is it the one you like the least?",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Wed.9": "If a tree falls in the forest and no one is there to witness it did it really fall?",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Wed.10": "So...what are young adults craving these days? I am trying to add new characteristics to my persona because apparently I am not selling the 'suave businessman' well enough.",
	
	"Faust.Dialogue.Thu.0": "Imagine your wildest dreams coming true the second you have them. Imagine how it feels like having everything you always wanted...#$b#...mhm.$$1#$b#I see.$4#$b#G o t  i t .$8#$b#Thanks for the input, you will hear from me in 65 business days.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Thu.1": "Do you have any profound life stories to tell? I am writing down my profile about you and I want to know if you go more towards tragic hero or mundanite.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Thu.2": "How many friends do you have? And how many of those you can really actually call your friends?#$b#Would they come for your rescue? To help you through a hard time? Die for you?$8#$b#Would you do the same for them?$9",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Thu.3": "Life can be such a drag sometimes, right?#$b#Wouldn't it be fun to be able to just escape and start somewhere new without any repercussions. Without the need to keep deadlines and such in mind?",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Thu.4": "Seasons greetings, friend.#$b#Somewhere, someplace there's always something to celebrate.#$b#...and something to mourn. Pick your favorite flavor.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Thu.5": "Have you ever thought about what is truly valuable?#$b#I'm not talking about things like diamonds or something. Those were just inflated in price by men because it happened to look pretty and be hard or whatever.#$b#You know, things like the clothes you wore when you got engaged, the letters from your parents, hand-made gifts from friends...THOSE are potent ingredients.#$b#Hm? Ingredients for what? Oh....I'll maybe tell you another time.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Thu.6": "Sorry about last night.#$b#You know that weird sound that sounded like someone was expiring?#$b#...yeah, not my proudest moment. I almost let it slip away.$6",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Thu.7": "I n s e r t  g e n e r i c  d i a l o g u e  h e r e .",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Thu.8": "Would you like to try a sample? [769]",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Thu.9": "Do you actually have free will or is whatever is controlling you just making you THINK you have free will? Hm, who knows.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Thu.10": "Relationships are kinda funky, not going to lie here.#$b#Usually for you mortals it's pretty simple to make out but the moment you step into something from a different plane...well, what meaning does family hold when your mind is already on a much bigger scale?#$b#What truly is 'a loved one' anyway?$2",
	
	"Faust.Dialogue.Fri.0": "You've quite some farm going already, don't you?#$b#Maybe I will stop by at some point, staring through your window when you least expect it.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Fri.1": "I've seen quite a few people own some sort of pet, do you think one would suit me as well?#$b#Master always says I am enough of a pet myself already though.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Fri.2": "You look famished. Try this. [308]",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Fri.3": "Whenever I see you run around doing your little errands I'm reminded of myself.#$b#Hm...you're bound down by so many more rules though...",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Fri.4": "A day full of errands again, how mundane.#$b#If you tell me something interesting I might bite the hand that feeds me so be careful.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Fri.5": "What do you think? I am a beacon of normalcy, right?#$b#The kids in town actually asked me why I look like that, can you believe it?#$b#I have no abnormal features at all.$8#$b#R i g h t ?",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Fri.6": "You know what's pretty funny?#$b#You. You're pretty funny.$1",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Fri.7": "The wind told me some secrets today.#$b#Most were about boring tea from yesterday but try it yourself. Sometimes you get to hear some tasty treats.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Fri.8": "When you're in an open body of water and hear someone when you're alone...maybe it's time to leave.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Fri.9": "I'd love to stop and talk to you but my head is full with my master telling me to do this and that...#$b#...literally by the way. They basically stream their thoughts right into my mind, sigh.$2",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Fri.10": "%He looks pretty distracted flicking through a notebook while humming an ominous tune.",
	
	"Faust.Dialogue.Sat.0": "Friendly entity.#$b#I've got nothing to say. Maybe you can fulfill my yearning of existence with a few joyous stories.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Sat.1": "If I told you there is some type of crop that once planted it'll forever regrow and be bountiful no matter the weather or soil condition would you want it?",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Sat.2": "Would you rather have unlimited bacon but no more video games or games, unlimited games, but no more games?",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Sat.3": "When I see all these wizards and witches around I like to jest sometimes.#$b#Nothing big. Maybe a shift in ley lines or a monster in the forest or two...",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Sat.4": "Do you ever wonder if what you do will leave an impact for generations to come?#$b#Maybe your life has no meaning once it's snuffed out but you're still alive so be merry and bountiful.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Sat.5": "I think it would be pretty dull if you were gone.#$b#Who else will pass out 2am on the spot? Who else just randomly tills the ground in the middle of the town and find a random artifact?#$b#Very entertaining what you do.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Sat.6": "Ah, there you go again, doing your little farmer things.#$b#This sparks joy.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Sat.7": "If there were two guys on the moon and one-...hang on...#$b#.........$6#$b#...I was just informed I have already reached my threshold of paradoxa for this week, hm.$2",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Sat.8": "No questions today. I am enjoying a thought-free moment right now.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Sat.9": "It's never too late to start anew.#$b#Or to run away from your problems.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Sat.10": "I am in quite a good mood today.#$b#What about you?",
	
	"Faust.Dialogue.Sun.0": "Another week ends. Time flies past quite quickly, eh?#$b#Actually, time is relative and you imagine it passing by fast because everything you experience is subjective and bound to your feelings and state of mind.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Sun.1": "Another week over, another step closer to the grave.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Sun.2": "This were overall pretty uneventful this week, don't you think?#$b#Hm, maybe I will help out next week to make things more exciting.$8",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Sun.3": "Any missed errands this week? I got everything done, not to toot my own horn but I like existing so I keep doing what my master tells me to.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Sun.4": "I think, therefore I am. So if I don't think I will cease to exist.#$b#Makes you wonder how all those 'no thought, head empty' people keep living on.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Sun.5": "The true meaning of life is garbage. 'Meaning' is subjective so it means something different to everyone so why care to begin with?",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Sun.6": "It's fascinating to see how mortals keep making promises to things like a new year.#$b#'New year, new me' or 'Next month I will start working out.' Things like that.#$b#Why wait when it just means getting closer to your mortal expiration date?",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Sun.7": "Good morning, good midday and good night.#$b#Goodbye.",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Sun.8": "I've been watching you for a while now and I think I am getting the hang of being human.#$b#I mean, of...being...I understand you better now. Yes.$2",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Sun.9": "%He turns around and throws something at you. [72]",
	"Faust.Dialogue.Sun.10": "I do talk to the others in town sometimes. They're awfully mundane and dull though.#$b#You're much more entertaining.$1",
	
	// SCHEDULE DIALOGUE
	"Faust.Schedule.Dialogue.000": "Maybe I could add some belladonna to this...hm...#$b#...I am sure this will be a great potion, yes.$4",
	"Faust.Schedule.Dialogue.001": "%He does not reply to you as you stare at him on the ground.",
	"Faust.Schedule.Dialogue.002": "Imagine just loitering around. Couldn't be me.$1",
	"Faust.Schedule.Dialogue.003": "Ever thought about selling your soul?#$b#No? Well, depending on the type you might end up rich.$1#$b#Still no interest?",
	"Faust.Schedule.Dialogue.004": "Excuse you, I'd like to have some time for myself right now. #$b#The drama these lost souls talk about is quite juicy.",
	"Faust.Schedule.Dialogue.005": "I could risk it to go into the saloon but I do not want to bother with compatibility so I'm standing here.#$b#Hm? Oh, I mean...I am a brooding loner who doesn't socialize.$2",
	"Faust.Schedule.Dialogue.006": "Hm? Oh...you want some snacks too?#$b#Here, try this one.[769]",
	"Faust.Schedule.Dialogue.007": "Master has sent me on errands in the desert...why?$2#$b#...It's plain boring but what can I do? That ground serpent marrow won't find itself...",
	
	//CONVERSATION TOPICS
	"Faust.ConverstationTopic.CTFaustFriendship": "You know...after all this time I have to admit that you've been quite a good listener.#$b#With the amount you talk to me one might think you're trying to win me over, heh.$1#$b#Everyone knows though that the way to a man's heart is through his stomach.$8",
}